// broken-compound-media-ownership (Incunabula Slice 3b D2, dsp-incubator cpe/docs/adr/0012-one-member-navigator-declared-layout.md) — a
// resource-detail with `media=` on the same resource ($id) as its page's
// compound-viewer navigator would render the compound's images twice; the
// navigator owns them. The resource-detail's own `media` is otherwise
// perfectly valid (mirrors good-compound-media's shape) so
// CompoundMediaOwnership is isolated.
site {
    title "Broken Compound Media Ownership"
    languages "de" "en"
}

page id="book" route="/books/:id" {
    resource-detail id="$id" class="Book" media="image"
    compound-viewer source="$id" layout="contents" index="rail"
}
